public PullResponse pull(String deviceId, String requestId) {
    String fingerprint = String.join("|", "task.pull", deviceId);
    return idempotency.execute(requestId, "task.pull", fingerprint, () -> {
        Device device = deviceService.findDevice(deviceId);
        var activeOrder = releaseRepository.findActiveByModel(device.model());
        if (activeOrder.isEmpty()) {
            return PullResponse.none();
        }
        ReleaseOrder order = releaseRepository.findByIdForUpdate(activeOrder.get().id())...
        var existing = taskRepository.findByReleaseAndDevice(order.id(), deviceId);
        if (existing.isPresent()) {
            return PullResponse.ofTask(TaskView.of(existing.get(), order));
        }
        if (!device.currentVersion().equals(order.fromVersion()) || device.bucketNo() >= order.ratio()) {
            return PullResponse.none();
        }
        // 维护窗口判定：仅当发布单开启开关且设备已配置窗口
        if (order.respectMaintenanceWindow() && device.hasMaintenanceWindow()) {
            Instant now = Instant.now(clock);
            if (!MaintenanceWindow.isInWindow(now, device.utcOffsetMinutes(), device.windowStartMinute(), device.windowEndMinute())) {
                Instant nextStart = MaintenanceWindow.nextWindowStartUtc(now, device.utcOffsetMinutes(), device.windowStartMinute());
                deferralRepository.increment(order.id(), deviceId, now.toString());
                return PullResponse.deferred(nextStart.toString());
            }
        }
        if (order.status() != ReleaseStatus.ACTIVE) {
            // PAUSED（或并发下 CANCELLED）：不下发新任务
            return order.respectMaintenanceWindow() && order.status() == ReleaseStatus.PAUSED
                    ? PullResponse.releasePaused() : PullResponse.none();
        }
        ... insert task ...
    });
}
```

Wait — ordering issue: previously the status check was combined with eligibility. Original: `if (order.status() != ACTIVE || !version.equals || bucket >= ratio) return null`. I split eligibility (version/bucket) from status. Order of checks now: eligibility → window → status. 

Hmm, but window check before status check means: PAUSED + outside window → DEFERRED (records deferral). PAUSED + in-window → RELEASE_PAUSED. That matches my earlier decision. But what about CANCELLED? findActiveByModel only finds ACTIVE/PAUSED (active_model non-null). After cancel, active_model = NULL so not found → none. But concurrent: order found, then cancelled before lock acquired → status CANCELLED. Original code returned null. With respectWindow on, return none() for CANCELLED. My code above: `order.respectMaintenanceWindow() && status == PAUSED ? releasePaused : none`. Good.

Should RELEASE_PAUSED be returned only when respectWindow is on? Spec: "发布单处于 PAUSED 时，窗口内拉取同样不下发新任务，但返回理由必须与顺延可区分" — this is in the context of the feature （开关开启）. When开关关闭， "保持现有拉取行为" → none. OK as coded.

Deferral recording: note "同一任务被顺延的累计次数" — keyed by (release, device). Also "不改任务状态" — we don't touch tasks. "也不计入失败率样本" — we don't touch round stats. Good.

One question: should the deferral be recorded when the release is PAUSED and device outside window? Per my ordering, yes. Acceptable.

Also idempotency replay: deferred response is stored and replayed — count not incremented again. Good.

Now update TaskService with DeferralRepository injected.

